## 2. 例题：合并石子

```cpp
// 合并相邻两堆石子，代价为重量之和，求最小总代价
int stoneMerge(int w[], int n) {
    int prefix[105] = {0};
    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) prefix[i] = prefix[i-1] + w[i];

    int dp[105][105] = {0};

    for (int len = 2; len <= n; len++) {
        for (int i = 1; i + len - 1 <= n; i++) {
            int j = i + len - 1;
            dp[i][j] = INT_MAX;
            for (int k = i; k < j; k++) {
                dp[i][j] = min(dp[i][j],
                    dp[i][k] + dp[k+1][j] + prefix[j] - prefix[i-1]);
            }
        }
    }
    return dp[1][n];
}
```

