## 3. 组合问题

```cpp
void combine(int start, int depth) {
    if (depth == k) {
        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) cout << path[i] << " ";
        cout << endl;
        return;
    }
    for (int i = start; i <= n; i++) {
        path[depth] = i;
        combine(i + 1, depth + 1);
    }
}
```

