# Flood Fill（洪水填充）

## 本章简介
Flood Fill是一种区域填充算法，常用于连通块计数。

![网格搜索与连通区域示意图](/img/diagrams/search-graph-annotated.svg)

---

## 1. DFS版Flood Fill

```cpp
int n, m;
int a[10][10];
bool vis[10][10];
int dx[4] = {0, 0, 1, -1};
int dy[4] = {1, -1, 0, 0};

void fill(int x, int y) {
    if (x < 0 || x >= n || y < 0 || y >= m) return;
    if (vis[x][y] || a[x][y] == 1) return;

    vis[x][y] = true;
    fill(x+1, y);
    fill(x-1, y);
    fill(x, y+1);
    fill(x, y-1);
}
```

---

## 2. BFS版Flood Fill

```cpp
void bfsFill(int sx, int sy) {
    queue<pair<int,int>> q;
    q.push({sx, sy});
    vis[sx][sy] = true;

    while (!q.empty()) {
        auto [x, y] = q.front();
        q.pop();

        for (int dir = 0; dir < 4; dir++) {
            int nx = x + dx[dir], ny = y + dy[dir];
            if (nx>=0 && nx<n && ny>=0 && ny<m && !vis[nx][ny] && a[nx][ny]!=1) {
                vis[nx][ny] = true;
                q.push({nx, ny});
            }
        }
    }
}
```

---

## 3. 连通块计数

```cpp
int countComponents() {
    int cnt = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        for (int j = 0; j < m; j++) {
            if (!vis[i][j] && a[i][j] != 1) {
                bfsFill(i, j);
                cnt++;
            }
        }
    }
    return cnt;
}
```

