## 2. 求约数个数

若 n = p₁^a₁ × p₂^a₂ × ... × pk^ak，则：

```
约数个数 = (a₁+1)(a₂+1)...(ak+1)
```

```cpp
int divisorCount(int n) {
    int cnt = 1;
    for (int i = 2; i * i <= n; i++) {
        int power = 0;
        while (n % i == 0) {
            n /= i;
            power++;
        }
        if (power > 0) cnt *= (power + 1);
    }
    if (n > 1) cnt *= 2;
    return cnt;
}
```

